{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54894","headline":"兵要望江南 占水族第二十一（京本列第十二○七首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占水族第二十一（京本列第十二○七首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，龟鼈入其营。\n尽是顿迟亡（首本作「忘」，此从辛本、川本）败象，速当移寨免灾凶，不去祸灾（辛本、川本作「将」）生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}